ormal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_whfcl_SecuredOvernightFinancingRateSofrThreeMonthTermMember_vBrQs2at806U86dlG3kzOg" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:RateOfInterestOnInvestmentPerDurationPeriod" scale="-2" id="Narr_et9RwGnUOkihlqAEyRgXVA">3.7</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> and </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_whfcl_SecuredOvernightFinancingRateSofrSixMonthTermMember_Fez1JNg5mEqZ19HtaSmW8A" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:RateOfInterestOnInvestmentPerDurationPeriod" scale="-2" id="Narr_mIn1v2Bb5UqU2cHLURuaLw">3.8</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">, respectively, as of June&#160;30,&#160;</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;white-space:pre-wrap;">2026.  The Prime was </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_us-gaap_PrimeRateMember_Afbs0d_gUE2PCT3nWFhzyQ" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:RateOfInterestOnInvestmentPerDurationPeriod" scale="-2" id="Narr_i2Tvy38Zu0eTxQZLE73yug">6.8</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> as of June&#160;30,&#160;</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;white-space:pre-wrap;">2026.  The three-month CORRA was </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_whfcl_CanadianOvernightRepoRateAverageMember_zonqr_BDhk2MjYX4yhRoMA" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:RateOfInterestOnInvestmentPerDurationPeriod" scale="-2" id="Narr_EnJRdH1960ae9YdAx-Rkkw">2.3</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;white-space:pre-wrap;">.  The one, three and six-month EurIBOR was </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_whfcl_EuroInterbankOfferedRateOneMonthTermMember_7g9qY6eeVkmpK3BclBWdkQ" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:RateOfInterestOnInvestmentPerDurationPeriod" scale="-2" id="Narr_cwwn64bO0US6US1x8u3kUg">2.2</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">, </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_whfcl_EuroInterbankOfferedRateThreeMonthTermMember_ikGTrBjiB0iwrkS8Uhrz1g" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:RateOfInterestOnInvestmentPerDurationPeriod" scale="-2" id="Narr_I5kZKzTLLE6zCLbOo0NPIA">2.3</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> and </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_whfcl_EuroInterbankOfferedRateSixMonthTermMember_ynciJseizEeG3-x2tMkeLQ" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:RateOfInterestOnInvestmentPerDurationPeriod" scale="-2" id="Narr_dZrNJrT2Xk6fsOUZxQDy0w">2.6</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">, respectively, as of June&#160;30,&#160;2026. The SONIA was </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_whfcl_SolarHoldingsBidcoLimitedFirstLienSecuredTermLoanSoniaMember_cF5mQ114eUmIqDqaZHUIxg" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:RateOfInterestOnInvestmentPerDurationPeriod" scale="-2" id="Narr_6qaPf2WZsEKP7_S4kKNTuA">3.7</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> as of June 30, 2026.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(3)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The interest rate is the &#8220;all-in-rate&#8221; including the current index and spread, the fixed rate, and the PIK interest rate, as the case may be.</span></td></tr></table><div style="margin-top:3.59pt;"></div><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(4)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Except as otherwise noted, all of STRS JV&#8217;s portfolio company investments, which as of the date of the portfolio represented </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_InvestmentCompanyNonconsolidatedSubsidiaryAxis_whfcl_StrsJvMember_uDO1xUcUCUaTACHkhKhHfA" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InvestmentOwnedPercentOfNetAssets" scale="-2" id="Narr_opbrwQtukEy6dSUxBIudXQ">1,000.0</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> of STRS JV&#8217;s members&#8217; equity or </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_InvestmentCompanyNonconsolidatedSubsidiaryAxis_whfcl_StrsJvMember_1b3GNclnJkaGUXHz9vWIrQ" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:PortfolioCompanyInvestmentsAsPercentageOfTotalAssets" scale="-2" id="Narr_H9qoNIm4LUStFiOZtxM1Ng">97.1</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;white-space:pre-wrap;">  of STRS JV&#8217;s total assets, are subject to legal restrictions on sales.</span></td></tr></table><div style="margin-top:3.59pt;"></div><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:3.59pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(5)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The fair value of each investment was determined using significant unobservable inputs.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:3.59pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(6)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The investment or a portion of the investment does not provide collateral for the STRS JV Credit Facility.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:3.59pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(7)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The investment was comprised of two contracts, which were indexed to SOFR (1M) and SOFR (3M).</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:3.59pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(8)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Principal amount is denominated in GBP and the issuer is domiciled in the United Kingdom.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:3.59pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(9)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Principal amount is denominated in EUR.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:3.59pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(10)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;white-space:pre-wrap;"> Principal amount is denominated in CAD.</span></td></tr></table></ix:continuation></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:2.75pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">45</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:93.09%;border:0;margin:30pt 3.45% 30pt 3.45%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:3.45%;padding-right:3.45%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:5.75pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">WhiteHorse Finance,&#160;Inc.</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Notes&#160;to Consolidated Financial Statements (Unaudited)</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">June&#160;30,&#160;2026</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 4pt 0pt;"><i style="font-style:italic;">(in thousands, except share and per share data)</i></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Group_9p8dV7aZFUOpgtZDVI0s9w_3_cont5" continuedAt="Group_9p8dV7aZFUOpgtZDVI0s9w_3_cont6"><ix:continuation id="Group_9nDqFLMj60iildejsuPpsA_2_cont1" continuedAt="Group_9nDqFLMj60iildejsuPpsA_3"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:3.59pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(11)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The rate shown is the annualized seven-day yield as of June&#160;30,&#160;2026.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:3.59pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(12)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Investment is structured as a unitranche loan in which the STRS JV may receive additional interest on its &#8220;last out&#8221; tranche of the portfolio company&#8217;s senior term debt, which was previously syndicated into &#8220;first out&#8221; and &#8220;last out&#8221; tranches, whereby the &#8220;first out&#8221; tranche will have priority as to the &#8220;last out&#8221; tranche with respect to payments of principal, interest and any other amounts due thereunder.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:3.59pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(13)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The investment was comprised of two contracts, which were indexed to Prime and SOFR (1M).</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:3.59pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(14)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The investment was comprised of two contracts, which were indexed to Prime and SOFR (3M).</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:3.59pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(15)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The investment was comprised of two contracts, which were indexed to Prime and SOFR (6M).</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(16)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The investment was comprised of two contracts, which were indexed to SOFR (3M) and SOFR (6M).</span></td></tr></table><div style="margin-top:3.59pt;"></div></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 3.59pt 18pt;"><span style="margin-left:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 3.59pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:2.75pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">46</p></div></div>
