HUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_InvestmentCompanyNonconsolidatedSubsidiaryAxis_whfcl_StrsJvMember_PEIURFwQyEype4qiSRq88g" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:PortfolioCompanyInvestmentsAsPercentageOfTotalAssets" scale="-2" id="Narr_zTUzo2ZUQEKgKwXMGCFFCQ">96.3</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">% of STRS JV&#8217;s total assets, are subject to legal restrictions on sales.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(5)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The fair value of each investment was determined using significant unobservable inputs.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(6)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The investment or a portion of the investment does not provide collateral for the STRS JV Credit Facility.</span></td></tr></table></ix:continuation></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:2.75pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">51</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:93.09%;border:0;margin:30pt 3.45% 30pt 3.45%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:3.45%;padding-right:3.45%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:5.75pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">WhiteHorse Finance,&#160;Inc.</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Notes&#160;to Consolidated Financial Statements (Unaudited)</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">June&#160;30,&#160;2026</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 4pt 0pt;"><i style="font-style:italic;">(in thousands, except share and per share data)</i></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Group_9p8dV7aZFUOpgtZDVI0s9w_3_cont11" continuedAt="Group_9p8dV7aZFUOpgtZDVI0s9w_3_cont12"><ix:continuation id="Group_9nDqFLMj60iildejsuPpsA_4_cont1"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(7)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The rate shown is the annualized seven-day yield as of December 31,&#160;2025.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(8)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Principal amount is denominated in GBP and the issuer is domiciled in the United Kingdom.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(9)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Principal amount is denominated in Euros.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(10)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;white-space:pre-wrap;"> Principal amount is denominated in CAD.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(11)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Investment is structured as a unitranche loan in which the STRS JV may receive additional interest on its &#8220;last out&#8221; tranche of the portfolio company&#8217;s senior term debt, which was previously syndicated into &#8220;first out&#8221; and &#8220;last out&#8221; tranches, whereby the &#8220;first out&#8221; tranche will have priority as to the &#8220;last out&#8221; tranche with respect to payments of principal, interest and any other amounts due thereunder</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(12)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The investment was comprised of two contracts, which were indexed to Prime and SOFR (1M).</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(13)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The investment was comprised of two contracts, which were indexed to Prime and SOFR (3M).</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(14)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The investment was comprised of two contracts, which were indexed to Prime and SOFR (6M).</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(15)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The investment was comprised of two contracts, which were indexed to SOFR (3M) and SOFR (6M).</span></td></tr></table><div style="margin-top:2pt;"></div></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;">As of June&#160;30,&#160;2026 and December&#160;31,&#160;2025, <span style="background:#ffffff;">the portfolio companies underlying STRS JV&#8217;s investments are all located in the United States and its territories except for Cennox Holdings Limited, which is domiciled in the United Kingdom.</span>&#160;</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;">As of June&#160;30,&#160;2026 and December&#160;31,&#160;2025, STRS JV had <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_AGiQhSd38EGpcvsuBHjTBQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_InvestmentCompanyNonconsolidatedSubsidiaryAxis_whfcl_StrsJvMember_uDO1xUcUCUaTACHkhKhHfA" decimals="-3" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="whfcl:InvestmentOwnedAtFairValueNonAccrualStatus" scale="3" id="Narr_ooZ7KZlNLUa__MIUgfKf4w"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_AGiQhSd38EGpcvsuBHjTBQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_InvestmentCompanyNonconsolidatedSubsidiaryAxis_whfcl_StrsJvMember_-LT5tb62RkOo_TqTz3zXEQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="whfcl:InvestmentOwnedAtFairValueNonAccrualStatus" scale="3" id="Narr_z4v3-AS9uk63WcdJcvGvIg">no</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> investments on non-accrual status. STRS JV had outstanding commitments to fund investments totaling $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_AGiQhSd38EGpcvsuBHjTBQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_InvestmentCompanyNonconsolidatedSubsidiaryAxis_whfcl_StrsJvMember_uDO1xUcUCUaTACHkhKhHfA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:OutstandingCommitmentsToFundInvestments" scale="3" id="Narr_V6iOo3V7HECdJUVPTxdfPA">40,230</ix:nonFraction>, and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_AGiQhSd38EGpcvsuBHjTBQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_InvestmentCompanyNonconsolidatedSubsidiaryAxis_whfcl_StrsJvMember_-LT5tb62RkOo_TqTz3zXEQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="whfcl:OutstandingCommitmentsToFundInvestments" scale="3" id="Narr_5LyiFAYRok--4lqbuqgsvQ">41,415</ix:nonFraction> under delayed draw term loan commitments and undrawn revolvers as of June&#160;30,&#160;2026 and December&#160;31,&#160;2025, respectively.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:2.75pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">52</p></div></div>
