R3RWkyIoBaKeFKEFg">5.375</ix:nonFraction>% and are due on October&#160;20, 2025, unless redeemed, purchased or prepaid prior to such date by the Company or its affiliates in accordance with their terms. Interest on the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="As_Of_10_20_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FivePointThreeSevenFivePercent2025NotesMember_mWm-FP4vf02XKygAlFeANA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_aRgwrwNP_k6wokbAbnjPhQ">5.375</ix:nonFraction>% 2025 Notes is payable semiannually on April 20 and October 20, at a fixed, annual rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="As_Of_10_20_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FivePointThreeSevenFivePercent2025NotesMember_mWm-FP4vf02XKygAlFeANA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_UH_19D6LrEWAU0JyPKvGnw">5.375</ix:nonFraction>%. This interest rate is subject to increase (up to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="As_Of_10_20_2020_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FivePointThreeSevenFivePercent2025NotesMember_AyYJrfV0cEW2iTFCK9m3aQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_4FnimwSCoUi2Jrq_zPK7Rw">6.375</ix:nonFraction>%) in the event that, subject to certain exceptions, the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="As_Of_10_20_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FivePointThreeSevenFivePercent2025NotesMember_mWm-FP4vf02XKygAlFeANA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_jHLYb78bGUOCMqgVc8ZxxQ">5.375</ix:nonFraction>% 2025 Notes&#160;cease to have an investment grade rating. In addition, the Company is obligated to offer to repay the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="As_Of_10_20_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FivePointThreeSevenFivePercent2025NotesMember_mWm-FP4vf02XKygAlFeANA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_MCTXXWQ2ekqO4kXT20LRUw">5.375</ix:nonFraction>% 2025 Notes&#160;at par if certain change in control events occur. The <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="As_Of_10_20_2020_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FivePointThreeSevenFivePercent2025NotesMember_mWm-FP4vf02XKygAlFeANA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_03bfiSGy9kaqM27SScPmnQ">5.375</ix:nonFraction>% 2025 Notes&#160;are general unsecured obligations of the Company that rank pari passu with all outstanding and future unsecured unsubordinated indebtedness issued by the Company. The closing of the transaction occurred on October 20 2020. The Company used the net proceeds from this offering to redeem existing debt. On September 29, 2025, the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="As_Of_9_29_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FivePointThreeSevenFivePercent2025NotesMember_3ulp-xosHEGNYGQ_FCQjIg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_3taA9S4sAkWVYtpiE-NfCw">5.375</ix:nonFraction>% 2025 Notes were fully repaid by the Company.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-style:solid;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:2.75pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">63</p></div></div>
