tInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FourPointTwoFiveZero2028NotesMember_R-n5XgJmo0KnESaI_TN4mw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_a2FhS9SAdEKCLzMPJQh12w">4.25</ix:nonFraction>%. This interest rate is subject to increase (up to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="As_Of_12_6_2021_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FourPointTwoFiveZero2028NotesMember_KZ64tve-3EKYwHncDivIVw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_rxKfG80aAUWXB2aOV-sUyw">5.25</ix:nonFraction>%) in the event that, subject to certain exceptions, the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="As_Of_12_6_2021_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FourPointTwoFiveZero2028NotesMember_R-n5XgJmo0KnESaI_TN4mw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_UrUAjf4NK0SI-hWsvhahOA">4.250</ix:nonFraction>% 2028 Notes cease to have an investment grade rating. The <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="As_Of_12_6_2021_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FourPointTwoFiveZero2028NotesMember_R-n5XgJmo0KnESaI_TN4mw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_cXInNrxUikGuC2EygkkeNg">4.250</ix:nonFraction>% 2028 Notes&#160;mature on December 6, 2028, unless redeemed, purchased or prepaid prior to such date by us or our affiliates in accordance with their terms. The <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="As_Of_12_6_2021_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_FourPointTwoFiveZero2028NotesMember_R-n5XgJmo0KnESaI_TN4mw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_0OI-Dqu0xEqxX26Q975eIQ">4.250</ix:nonFraction>% 2028 Notes are general unsecured obligations that rank pari passu with all outstanding and future unsecured unsubordinated indebtedness that we may issue. The closing of the transaction occurred on December 6, 2021.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="text-decoration-color:#000000;text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-style:solid;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="As_Of_8_24_2023_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_SevenPointEightSevenFive2028NotesMember_7yMtbf4YL0yRpytdIMgGJQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_oEX36QJtfUWXnbAhrqOH-w">7.875</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="text-decoration-color:#000000;text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-style:solid;"> 2028 Notes</span>: On August 24, 2023, the Company completed a public offering of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="As_Of_8_24_2023_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_SevenPointEightSevenFive2028NotesMember_7yMtbf4YL0yRpytdIMgGJQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_SC2GE2QkkE6vkpaAs7prRw">7.875</ix:nonFraction>% 2028 Notes in aggregate principal amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_AGiQhSd38EGpcvsuBHjTBQ" contextRef="As_Of_8_24_2023_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_SevenPointEightSevenFive2028NotesMember_7yMtbf4YL0yRpytdIMgGJQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="3" id="Narr_xx_9wMn6HUykkETDdllGGQ">30,000</ix:nonFraction>. On August 31, 2023, the underwriters fully exercised their option to purchase an additional $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_AGiQhSd38EGpcvsuBHjTBQ" contextRef="Duration_8_31_2023_To_8_31_2023_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_SevenPointEightSevenFive2028NotesMember_ebl0YD3Q5U2rurrQlnPFyw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfDebt" scale="3" id="Narr_x6HcGiP7iEu3Tw4czqGZwQ">4,500</ix:nonFraction>, bringing the aggregate principal amount of the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="As_Of_8_31_2023_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_SevenPointEightSevenFive2028NotesMember_2K_mJNHsd0ilRox7A4H_fA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_IeDgylEfh0-Hi8yxC1BnbA">7.875</ix:nonFraction>% 2028 Notes to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_AGiQhSd38EGpcvsuBHjTBQ" contextRef="As_Of_8_31_2023_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_SevenPointEightSevenFive2028NotesMember_2K_mJNHsd0ilRox7A4H_fA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="3" id="Narr_pV7BQ34-ik6qrZGkceU7Ug">34,500</ix:nonFraction>. Interest on the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="As_Of_8_31_2023_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_SevenPointEightSevenFive2028NotesMember_2K_mJNHsd0ilRox7A4H_fA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_YAGBKiJ3K0aNdA4Prs-27w">7.875</ix:nonFraction>% 2028 Notes is paid quarterly on March 15, June 15, September 15 and December 15 each year, at an annual rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="As_Of_8_31_2023_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_SevenPointEightSevenFive2028NotesMember_2K_mJNHsd0ilRox7A4H_fA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_L74moq9px0agapaGleSovg">7.875</ix:nonFraction>%. The <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="As_Of_8_31_2023_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_SevenPointEightSevenFive2028NotesMember_2K_mJNHsd0ilRox7A4H_fA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_nGxOeygyw0-Z2Pfm984xjg">7.875</ix:nonFraction>% 2028 Notes will mature on September 15, 2028 and may be redeemed in whole or in part at any time, or from time to time, at the Company&#8217;s option on or after September 15, 2025. The <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="As_Of_8_31_2023_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_SevenPointEightSevenFive2028NotesMember_2K_mJNHsd0ilRox7A4H_fA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_HNHdhAAaiU6_EOyX96si_A">7.875</ix:nonFraction>% 2028 Notes are direct unsecured obligations and are structurally subordinate to borrowings under the Credit Facility and will rank pari passu with all outstanding and future unsecured unsubordinated indebtedness we may issue. The <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5-a6OUbAHUyLzLTqFwSM-w" contextRef="As_Of_8_31_2023_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_whfcl_SevenPointEightSevenFive2028NotesMember_2K_mJNHsd0ilRox7A4H_fA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_FzXlS88xW0SM7PdkHxZ2oA">7.875</ix:nonFraction>% 2028 Notes are listed on the Nasdaq Global Select Market under the trading symbol &#8220;WHFCL.&#8221;</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:2.75pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">64</p></div></div>
